{"id":"5b3973229f456864","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/798_J_3.md","title":"798 J 3","display":"798_J_3","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"798-J_3\">798 J_3</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子的型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,\\circ A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,\\circ A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cons}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{cons}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{J3}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{J3}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{J3}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{cons}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{cons}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{J3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{J3}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{J3}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{J3}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,J3}\\ \\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,J3}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,J3}\\ \\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,J3}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-三值载体与指定值\">4. 三值载体与指定值</h1>\n<p>真值集合与指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{J3}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{J3}=\\{\\tfrac12,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{J3}=\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{J3}=\\{\\tfrac12,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底常元解释函数为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{J3}=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot_{J3}=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-真值运算\">5. 真值运算</h1>\n<p>否定与一致性算子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{J3},\\circ_{J3}:\\mathsf V_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{J3},\\circ_{J3}:\\mathsf V_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{J3}0=1,\\qquad\n\\neg_{J3}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\n\\neg_{J3}1=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{J3}0=1,\\qquad\n\\neg_{J3}\\tfrac12=\\tfrac12,\\qquad\n\\neg_{J3}1=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{J3}0=1,\\qquad\n\\circ_{J3}\\tfrac12=0,\\qquad\n\\circ_{J3}1=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\circ_{J3}0=1,\\qquad\n\\circ_{J3}\\tfrac12=0,\\qquad\n\\circ_{J3}1=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>二元联结词为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{J3},\\vee_{J3},\\Rightarrow_{J3}:\n\\mathsf V_{J3}\\times\\mathsf V_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_{J3},\\vee_{J3},\\Rightarrow_{J3}:\n\\mathsf V_{J3}\\times\\mathsf V_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_{J3}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{J3}b=\\max(a,b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_{J3}b=\\min(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{J3}b=\\max(a,b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_{J3}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a=0,\\\\\nb,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf D_{J3}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\Rightarrow_{J3}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;a=0,\\\\\nb,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf D_{J3}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-赋值与公式值\">6. 赋值与公式值</h1>\n<p>赋值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{J3}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{J3}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf V_{J3}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{J3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{J3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{J3}\\overline v(A),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\circ_{J3}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{J3}\\overline v(A),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\circ_{J3}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{J3}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{J3}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{J3}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{J3}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{J3}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{J3}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义后承与证书\">7. 语义后承与证书</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\)</span>，反例证书函数的型别及定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{J3}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{J3}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{J3}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{J3})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{J3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{J3}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{J3})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{J3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{J3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{J3}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义证书关系的型别及定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{J3}\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{J3}\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>空前提后承集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{J3}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{J3}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{J3}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{J3}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-结构规则与证明层排除\">8. 结构规则与证明层排除</h1>\n<p>分离规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MPRule}_{J3}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MPRule}_{J3}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MPRule}_{J3}\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MPRule}_{J3}\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代换规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{J3}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{J3}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{J3}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{J3}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{J3}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{J3}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{J3}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{J3}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{J3}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{J3}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个语义形式系统\">9. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{J3}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{J3},\n\\widehat{(\\cdot)},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,J3},\n\\mathsf V_{J3},\n\\mathsf D_{J3},\n\\bot_{J3},\n\\neg_{J3},\n\\circ_{J3},\n\\wedge_{J3},\n\\vee_{J3},\n\\Rightarrow_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{J3},\n\\overline{(\\cdot)},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{J3},\n\\Vdash_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{MPRule}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{SubRule}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{J3}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{J3}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{J3},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{J3},\n\\widehat{(\\cdot)},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,J3},\n\\mathsf V_{J3},\n\\mathsf D_{J3},\n\\bot_{J3},\n\\neg_{J3},\n\\circ_{J3},\n\\wedge_{J3},\n\\vee_{J3},\n\\Rightarrow_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{J3},\n\\overline{(\\cdot)},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{J3},\n\\Vdash_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{MPRule}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{SubRule}_{J3},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{J3}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是 J3/LFI1 的条件算子满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\Rightarrow_{J3}b=1\">\\(0\\Rightarrow_{J3}b=1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_{J3}b=b\">\\(a\\Rightarrow_{J3}b=b\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 指定），而不是 P1 的二值输出条件算子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{J3}\\tfrac12=0\">\\(\\circ_{J3}\\tfrac12=0\\)</span> 精确检测矛盾值。该系统只含语义矩阵、赋值、反例证书、语义后承和显式结构规则，不含 Hilbert 公理化证明系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"798-J_3","text":"798 J_3","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-三值载体与指定值","text":"4. 三值载体与指定值","level":1},{"id":"5.-真值运算","text":"5. 真值运算","level":1},{"id":"6.-赋值与公式值","text":"6. 赋值与公式值","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义后承与证书","text":"7. 语义后承与证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-结构规则与证明层排除","text":"8. 结构规则与证明层排除","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个语义形式系统","text":"9. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{J3}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons},\n\\operat